cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "cosamGasDamper: automated large-stroke CFD of gas-filled piston-cylinder dampers with multiple orifices"
abstract: >-
  Configuration-driven OpenFOAM framework for gas springs and gas-filled piston-cylinder dampers. One YAML file
  and one command produce the parametric geometry, hexahedral sub-meshes for one to ten orifices (SALOME and Gmsh),
  a segmented multi-mesh compressible moving-mesh simulation of the whole stroke (rhoPimpleFoam), time series,
  a force and energy summary, and headless ParaView renderings; a sweep runner executes parameter studies under a
  core budget.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-07
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/COSAM-BTU/cosamGasDamper"
keywords:
  - OpenFOAM
  - gas spring
  - gas damper
  - moving mesh
  - compressible orifice flow
  - workflow automation
